{"id":"96267a91020ab600","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-recursion.md","title":"Recursion Lemma","display":"lem-recursion — Recursion Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-recursion","aliases":["88-lem-recursion"],"display":"lem-recursion — Recursion Lemma","depends_on":["[[88-df-recursion-theorem]]","[[88-df-smn-theorem]]","[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-computable-function]]","[[88-df-kleene-equality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-recursion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-recursion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-recursion — Recursion Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0d94132cfe19e7e\" href=\"?note=c0d94132cfe19e7e\" title=\"88-df-recursion-theorem\">88-df-recursion-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb79833a139e232\" href=\"?note=1eb79833a139e232\" title=\"88-df-smn-theorem\">88-df-smn-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a> 的共同编号环境，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为总索引变换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(s:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为候选参数函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}\">\\(\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1eb79833a139e232\" href=\"?note=1eb79833a139e232\" title=\"88-df-smn-theorem\">88-df-smn-theorem</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFP}\">\\(\\mathrm{KFP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c0d94132cfe19e7e\" href=\"?note=c0d94132cfe19e7e\" title=\"88-df-recursion-theorem\">88-df-recursion-theorem</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\forall f\\;\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\nf:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(f)\n\\land\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}(s)\n\\to\\mathrm{KFP}(f)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\forall f\\;\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\nf:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(f)\n\\land\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}(s)\n\\to\\mathrm{KFP}(f)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}(s)\">\\(\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}(s)\\)</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_1,\\Phi_2\">\\(\\Phi_1,\\Phi_2\\)</span> 都是有效满编号，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 总可计算。二元部分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的图定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g=\\{\\langle\\langle z,x\\rangle,y\\rangle:\nz,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\varphi_{f(s(z,z))}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g=\\{\\langle\\langle z,x\\rangle,y\\rangle:\nz,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\varphi_{f(s(z,z))}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>先计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(z,z)\">\\(s(z,z)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(s(z,z))\">\\(f(s(z,z))\\)</span>，再调用一元通用求值器，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 部分可计算。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=\\varphi_d^{(2)}\">\\(g=\\varphi_d^{(2)}\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=s(d,d)\">\\(e=s(d,d)\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq\\varphi_d^{(2)}(d,x)\n\\simeq\\varphi_{f(s(d,d))}(x)=\\varphi_{f(e)}(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq\\varphi_d^{(2)}(d,x)\n\\simeq\\varphi_{f(s(d,d))}(x)=\\varphi_{f(e)}(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>最后一步仅替换相同索引；前两步均用 Kleene 等式，包含共同发散。因此两个部分函数图相等。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 假设确实承担了对角参数固化，而非冗余标签。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"c0d94132cfe19e7e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-recursion-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-smn-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"1eb79833a139e232","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-smn-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"resolved","id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-kleene-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}$ 是 [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]] 的共同编号环境，$\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}$。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}$ 见 [[88-df-smn-theorem]]；$\\mathrm{KFP}$ 见 [[88-df-recursion-theorem]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-smn-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"1eb79833a139e232","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}$ 见 [[88-df-smn-theorem]]；$\\mathrm{KFP}$ 见 [[88-df-recursion-theorem]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"c0d94132cfe19e7e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}$ 见 [[88-df-smn-theorem]]；$\\mathrm{KFP}$ 见 [[88-df-recursion-theorem]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"resolved","id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}$ 见 [[88-df-smn-theorem]]；$\\mathrm{KFP}$ 见 [[88-df-recursion-theorem]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KFP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\forall f\\;\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\nf:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(f)\n\\land\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}(s)\n\\to\\mathrm{KFP}(f)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_1,\\Phi_2","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"g=\\{\\langle\\langle z,x\\rangle,y\\rangle:\nz,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\varphi_{f(s(z,z))}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"s(z,z)","display":false},{"tex":"f(s(z,z))","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"g=\\varphi_d^{(2)}","display":false},{"tex":"e=s(d,d)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq\\varphi_d^{(2)}(d,x)\n\\simeq\\varphi_{f(s(d,d))}(x)=\\varphi_{f(e)}(x).","display":true},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1757,"backlinks":[{"id":"c0d94132cfe19e7e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-lem-recursion]] 明确使用 $s$-$m$-$n$ 前提推出固定点；[[88-thm-kleene-recursion]] 再由可接受编号推出该前提。因此性质、足够条件与存在性定理不再混在一个定义式里。"},{"id":"75e301ab0a784049","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f$ 为候选总可计算索引变换。所需的参数函数存在性由 [[88-thm-smn]] 提供，固定点推导见 [[88-lem-recursion]]。"}],"outgoing":["c0d94132cfe19e7e","1eb79833a139e232","b955b7851c500bfe","64279ecae5246baf","5f7e8cd4c12441fb"]}